msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What were those guys up to just now...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Looks like they dropped this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"You got <Color:255,255,200,255>Ryukyu Locker Key No. 44<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Nnnnnnnnwwwoooooaaagghhhhh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "(Yeah, there's definitely a voice coming out of there.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Hey, old man... Isn't it past your bedtime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"You better run on home. Lotta crazy shit goes down around here at night, if "
"you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you're right."
msgstr "Già, immagino tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear. And you stay the hell away from\r\n"
"this place come sundown, got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"There's a weird sound coming from Locker 44. You boys ever\r\n"
"hear of the cursed locker rumors going around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Whoa, whoa, whoa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "How the hell'd you know about Locker 44!? Who told ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Oh, so there is something suspicious going on here. Thanks for confirming "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Yeah? Well let me confirm something else for you: anyone who knows about "
"this locker gets the living shit kicked out of 'em!"
msgstr ""

